{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2022-12", "window": 2, "start_date": 1670544000, "end_date": 1671148799, "month_true_total": 808, "quota": 6, "returned": 6, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:57:51 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "128614106", "author": {"steamid": "76561198860581751", "personaname": "弗洛里达皮划艇", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/398357181/", "num_games_owned": 144, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 136618, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 121424, "last_played": 1754646630, "avatar": "4a980de5087cdab07bbc5f0505cdb3e6f9c0ff36"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "不是很好玩。", "timestamp_created": 1671124033, "timestamp_updated": 1671124033, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 8, "weighted_vote_score": "0.574516475200653076", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "128610237", "author": {"steamid": "76561198851566538", "personaname": "青春猪头G7人马文不会梦到JK黑丝铁驭艾许", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198851566538/", "num_games_owned": 302, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 19292, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5077, "last_played": 1778684362, "avatar": "63a4d48133696f550967475698023aaec6ca3b89"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "史上最好玩的合作游戏，没有之一！不接受任何反驳！！\n\n今天熬夜过了精深第二关。当守卫者的血条消失并倒下的那一刻，我简直无法用语言来形容我的激动与喜悦之情。\n这才叫合作游戏，这才叫真正的合作游戏！\n\n队友给力，补给管够，才能carry全场，在此感谢那些曾经跟我一起并肩作战的队友们，你们都是最英勇的矮人！！\n我要向你们致敬VVVVVVV！挖到手软，赚到盆满！！干得漂亮，矿工们！！！\n\n百折不挠，装备齐全的矮人\n招式五花八门，数量如天上繁星般的敌人\n各种各样的矿物\n以及100%可破坏的地型\n\n跟tm打星战似的，爽死力！爽爽爽爽爽爽爽爽爽爽爽爽死了！\n爽到忍不了，直接一拳把霍克斯星干爆！！\n这游戏真是太踏马的好玩了啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！\n\n让我们再来亿遍，ROCK AND STONE!!!\n挖到手软，赚到盆满！干得漂亮，矿工们！\n\n------12.15更新------\n今晚出了圣诞节主题活动，游戏大厅里也全部都是圣诞装扮，开了8人mod，可以一起打雪仗，喝啤酒，跳舞\n\n甚至还把显示屏和迪斯科灯球搬到地面踢足球，正好最近也是世界杯，游戏氛围直接拉满\n\n也可能是工作和学习太忙的缘故，已经不知道多久没有体会到这种快乐了（有点怀念上学的日子，元旦会布置教室，氛围也真的超棒）\n\n工作学习之余用来解压真的很不错，尤其是开了8人或更多人的mod，真的是人越多越好玩\n\n当然打游戏的时间很欢乐，但也仅限于放松一下自己，更多还是要把经历放在工作学习上，希望有生之年也能赚到盆满钵满，实现游戏自由\n\nROCK AND STONE FOREVER !!\n", "timestamp_created": 1671119536, "timestamp_updated": 1671119536, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.562919855117797852", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "128603741", "author": {"steamid": "76561199096771960", "personaname": "adlom", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199096771960/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 7273, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5274, "last_played": 1719723360, "avatar": "c2e59050aa19124037716915b5c03507e31b46b3"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "这款游戏是属于我游戏库里罕见能玩这么久的好游戏，真的不错！", "timestamp_created": 1671111506, "timestamp_updated": 1671111506, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "128603408", "author": {"steamid": "76561199049176847", "personaname": "你干嘛哎呦", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199049176847/", "num_games_owned": 42, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 316, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 196, "last_played": 1689429488, "avatar": "e87bcc3593bca5d9a45b2917ec17c96264b51059"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "好玩", "timestamp_created": 1671111030, "timestamp_updated": 1671111030, "voted_up